  'Café value'
quoted: "<< item >>"
items: [<< a,b >>]
body: !markdown |
  Keep __strong__ and << literal  bytes >>.
plain: !markdown |
  Keep **strong** and `literal  bytes`.
attached: !markdown |
  Keep **attached**.
ok: [x, y]
